### T10 — Chat en Tiempo Real API
### Usar con la extensión REST Client de VS Code

@base = http://localhost:3000
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN
@roomId = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ID_DE_SALA
@msgId  = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ID_DE_MENSAJE

# =============================================
# AUTH
# =============================================

### Registrar usuario
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login (copia el token de la respuesta en @token arriba)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Perfil propio
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# =============================================
# ROOMS
# =============================================

### Listar salas (público)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms

###

### Crear sala
POST {{base}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general",
  "description": "Canal general"
}

###

### Historial de mensajes
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Historial con paginación
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Búsqueda de mensajes (bonus)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages?search=hola
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# =============================================
# MENSAJES (bonus REST)
# =============================================

### Editar mensaje propio
PATCH {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages/{{msgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Mensaje editado"
}

###

### Eliminar mensaje propio
DELETE {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages/{{msgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Añadir/quitar reacción emoji (bonus)
POST {{base}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages/{{msgId}}/reactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "👍"
}

###

# =============================================
# ERRORES — verificar manejo correcto
# =============================================

### 401 — sin token
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

###

### 404 — sala inexistente
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/000000000000000000000000/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 409 — sala duplicada
POST {{base}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general"
}

###

### 404 — ruta inexistente
GET {{base}}/api/noexiste
